{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45455","headline":"寿昌节赋得红云表夏日 · 栖白","name":"寿昌节赋得红云表夏日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"景候融融阴气潜，如峰云共火相兼。\n霞光捧日登天上，丹彩乘风入殿檐。\n行逐赤龙千岁出，明当朱夏万方瞻。\n微臣多幸逢佳节，得赋殊祥近御帘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"栖白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45455.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45455","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}